    "sections": {
        "description": "This Product Manufacturing theme is thoughtfully developed to meet the needs of industrial businesses seeking a clean and structured online presence. It offers a well-organized layout to present products, services, production workflows, certifications, and company details in a clear and accessible manner. The theme focuses on usability, allowing businesses to communicate technical information effectively without unnecessary complexity. It includes customizable homepage sections, a flexible product catalog layout, responsive design for multiple devices, SEO-friendly structure, Gutenberg compatibility, and WooCommerce integration for managing online sales. Additional features such as translation readiness, typography controls, and lightweight code contribute to consistent performance and accessibility. Ideal for factories, suppliers, engineering companies, and manufacturing units, this theme provides a reliable and functional base for creating a professional website tailored to industry-specific requirements."
    },
